  "beer-hagolah:10:א": `There 12`,
  "beer-hagolah:10:ב": `Likewise in chapter 17 in the name of Rashba`,
  "beer-hagolah:11:א": `There in the Gemara 15, and Abbaye — and this is one of the laws — see end Magen Avraham`,
  "beer-hagolah:11:ב": `There`,
