  "beer-hagolah:13:א": `Thus`,
  "beer-hagolah:13:ב": `Mishnah`,
  "beer-hagolah:14:א": `There 11`,
  "beer-hagolah:14:ב": `There 8 in the Gemara, and as Rava — Rif, Rosh, and Rambam in chapter 17`,
  "beer-hagolah:15:_": `Rosh there regarding lechi standing by itself, and the Maggid in chapter 17 in the name of Rashba`,
  "beer-hagolah:16:א": `Mishnah there 53`,
  "beer-hagolah:16:ב": `There in the Gemara 80, and as R' Chiyya bar Ashi`,
  "beer-hagolah:17:א": `Mishnah there 13, and per the first Tanna`,
  "beer-hagolah:17:ב": `There in the Gemara 14, and as R' Elai said Rav — Rosh, and Mordechai in the name of R' Chaim there, and likewise in chapter 17 in the name of Rashba`,
  "beer-hagolah:18:א": `There in the Gemara, and per Rashi's explanation`,
  "beer-hagolah:18:ב": `As Rav Chisda there — Rambam in chapter 17 and Semag`,
  "beer-hagolah:18:ג": `As Ravah bar Rav Huna — Rosh in the name of R' Meir, and he agreed with him`,
  "beer-hagolah:19:_": `Mishnah 14`,
  "beer-hagolah:20:_": `There in the Gemara in the explanation of the Mishnah`,
  "beer-hagolah:21:_": `Baraita there`,
  "beer-hagolah:22:א": `Baraita there`,
  "beer-hagolah:22:ב": `Rambam in chapter 17`,
  "beer-hagolah:22:ג": `Tur, and so too Hagahot Maimoniyot Chadashot in the name of Maharam, and so explained R' Yehonatan`,
  "beer-hagolah:23:א": `In the item — R' Yosi bar Yehuda there; Tur in the name of Rambam`,
  "beer-hagolah:23:ב": `Rambam there`,
  "beer-hagolah:23:ג": `Tur in the name of R' Meir of Rothenburg and his father Rosh, and so it is in the version of Rif that the halacha is not like R' Yosi bar Yehuda`,
  "beer-hagolah:24:א": `There in the Gemara`,
  "beer-hagolah:24:ב": `Rosh there, and not like Rashba, and so ruled the Tur`,
  "beer-hagolah:25:_": `There 8, per the resolution of Rav Ashi, and per Rashi's explanation`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:א": `There in the Gemara 6`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ב": `Mishnah beginning of Eruvin`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ג": `There in the Gemara 20`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ד": `Mishnah beginning of Eruvin, and as Rav there in the Gemara 3`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ה": `Beit Yosef, and so wrote likewise in chapter 17`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ו": `There in the Gemara 3, and as Rav Dimi, and per R' Yehonatan's explanation`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ז": `There in the Gemara, and as Rav Yosef — Rif, Rosh, and Rambam in chapter 17`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ח": `There 5, and as Abbaye — for anything less than ten is not called a wall and requires correction in the measure of the length of the mavo, per Abbaye`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ט": `There 12`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:י": `Tosafos and Rosh, and per Rashi's explanation, and Shabbos`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:כ": `Thus it should read — that they ruled that the halacha is not like Rav`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ל": `The Maggid in chapter 17 from the Tur`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:מ": `There, and in the Gemara 73 — a question and resolution`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:נ": `Rosh and Hagahot Maimoniyot in chapter 2 from the Tur, from the conclusion of the Gemara there, and so on`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ס": `There 12`,
  "beer-hagolah:26:ע": `There in Rashi's explanation`,
